{"title":"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Elisa swims laps in the pool. When she first started, she completed 10 laps in 25 minutes. Now, she can finish 12 laps in 24 minutes. By how many minutes has she improved her lap time?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bb06859dfdcf0a068fac7add61c5d3a4a2dcb2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{3}{4}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"356\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When Elisa started, she finished a lap in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/5/8d5f767844bb46d34379256116d47841b0ced0b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{25}{10}=2.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"69\" height=\"38\" /> minutes. Now, she finishes a lap is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/a/91ac50f0315fe3de666c7df5fc9a36c4bfe0caf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{12}= 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"55\" height=\"37\" /> minutes. The difference is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8eb21399acd7a59b0cee39a024eff71cf199589.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5-2=\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{1}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"138\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/7L-_NCF3DPQ\">https://youtu.be/7L-_NCF3DPQ</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8\" title=\"2006 AMC 8\">2006 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2006\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2006 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006